<!-- A sun: twelve tapered rays around a solid disc — the mark for "SOL". Drawn on the 108dp
     adaptive canvas with the figure inside a 64dp circle, within the 66dp safe zone, so no launcher
     mask (circle, squircle, teardrop) can clip a ray tip.

     One fill colour, deliberately: this same drawable is the <monochrome> layer, which Android 13+
     tints with the wallpaper palette for themed icons. A two-tone figure collapses to a silhouette
     there and loses its detail; a single shape reads identically in both.

     An original sun mark in the app's red, NOT a reproduction of the OCBC corporate logotype.
     Swap in official artwork when it is available. -->
